["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"270.大廠押注AI辦公，飛書和釘釘卻先成了配角 Agent ARR CAPEX GEO\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-01-luanfanshu-飞书钉钉退场-ai办公的主角成了个人agent/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/490e0c935e82c209-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"亂\"><span class=\"dur\">1:37:09</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">亂翻書</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0801</span></div>\n<h2>飛書釘釘退場，AI辦公主角成了個人Agent</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">飛書被併入豆包、釘釘讓位千問辦公，企業IM歷史使命終結；AI辦公的核心從組織協同轉向個人生產力，coding能力成為Agent底座。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI辦公</span><span class=\"tag\">飛書</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"E246｜何謂蒸餾？聊聊硅谷如何看中國開放模型逼近前沿 logits scaling efficiency KV cache harness Exploit Bench\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-01-sv101-开源模型追平闭源-蒸馏指控站不住脚/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cfe8fa9f8e3fa476-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"硅\"><span class=\"dur\">1:07:12</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">硅谷101</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0801</span></div>\n<h2>開源模型追平閉源，蒸餾指控站不住腳</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">K3 與 Fable 發布只隔約 15 天，蒸餾在時間上根本來不及；真正讓閉源實驗室焦慮的是模型從壟斷品變成流通商品，估值體系要重算。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">開源模型</span><span class=\"tag\">蒸餾</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Building an Autonomous Enterprise for Real-World Services with Netic Founder Melisa Tokmak roll-up essential services harness vaporware\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-07-31-nopriors-ai-只用来砍成本-是件很可悲的事/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8e65a40709afebff-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">34:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">No Priors</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0731</span></div>\n<h2>AI 只用來砍成本，是件很可悲的事</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Netic 創始人 Melisa Tokmak 說，私人股本見她的第一面永遠先談降本，但她真正賣的是讓這些公司賺到淨新增收入——她的客戶已因此多賺 6 億美元。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">垂直 AI</span><span class=\"tag\">企業銷售</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Arsenic and Lace: The Trial of the Yorkshire Witch - with Maddy Pelling pleading the belly bottle conjurer ill wishes / well wishes\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-07-31-cautionary-约克郡女巫罪案-骗局的核心是权力欲/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b996da73a08744ac-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">43:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Cautionary Tales</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0731</span></div>\n<h2>女騙子死後被解剖示眾：她威脅的不是錢，是秩序</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">18世紀女騙子瑪麗·貝特曼以算命和毒餅行騙，不圖錢財而享受掌控。她的騙術精準命中人性渴望，死後仍被解剖展示，揭示社會對秩序顛覆者的恐懼。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">騙局</span><span class=\"tag\">心理操控</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"149. 親歷中美neo labs資本狂潮，和清華劉子鳴聊：AI for AI、機制可解釋性和Max Tegmark Physics of AI Mechanistic Interpretability Meta Model Recursive Superintelligence (RSI)\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-07-30-zhangxiaojun-ai-for-ai-关键在于建立ai的物理学/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ba3f758130e67a9c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:40:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0730</span></div>\n<h2>AI 研究的下一個突破：先給 AI 建立物理學，再讓它自己發現架構</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">劉子明提出真正的AFAI不是寫論文或改訓練管線，而是用物理學方法先把研究結構化，再訓練原模型預測訓練曲線，最終讓AI自己發現下一代架構。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI for AI</span><span class=\"tag\">機制可解釋性</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Ep 264: David Deutsch&#x27;s &quot;The Fabric of Reality&quot; Chapter 14 &quot;The Ends of the Universe&quot; Part 1 Turing-Deutsch principle mathematician&#x27;s misconception Omega Point Theory crypto inductivist\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-07-30-tokcast-知识创造者比恒星活得久-所以认识论是物理学/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cee80eb6567ee2d2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">44:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">ToKCast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0730</span></div>\n<h2>知識創造者比恆星活得久，所以認識論是物理學</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">把量子力學、計算、進化、認識論四條線擰成一股，結論是：只要人類不停解決問題，宇宙的長期結構將由知識而非引力決定。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">認識論</span><span class=\"tag\">量子計算</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Is Sequence of Returns Overrated? (&amp; Other Questions) | Rational Reminder 420 Sequence of Returns Risk Sequence of Withdrawals Risk Block Bootstrap Lifecycle Model\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-07-30-rationalreminder-杠杆投资理论上成立-但没人真的执行第二步/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ef6dd6e7563e1ad0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:51:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Rational Reminder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0730</span></div>\n<h2>槓桿投資理論上成立，但沒人真的執行第二步</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">論文說年輕人該按一生總財富加槓桿，但還清房貸的客戶再也沒借回來。序列收益風險只在取款固定時才是問題，改成可變取款，組合體操就不需要了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">槓桿投資</span><span class=\"tag\">退休規劃</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Free Will: Does It Exist? Emergence Clockwork universe fMRI EEG\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-07-30-sciencevs-大脑早七秒做决定-自由意志依然存在/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a3282246c3202bd6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">31:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Science Vs</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0730</span></div>\n<h2>腦信號早七秒出現，原作者卻說自由意志還在</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">李貝特與海恩斯實驗顯示腦信號比「你決定」早半秒到七秒，但原作者否認這等於沒有自由意志；兼容論認為意志可能是微觀大腦過程的宏觀湧現，如同溫度之於原子。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自由意志</span><span class=\"tag\">神經科學</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"175: 對話Liblib陳冕：關於活下來，以及所有接近死亡的時刻 PMF Reward model LTV GTM AI native ARR\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-07-30-latetalk-ai-应用公司的最优解是活下来-而不是创新/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ff075962598c10e7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"晚\"><span class=\"dur\">2:08:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">晚點聊</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0730</span></div>\n<h2>AI 應用公司活下來比創新更重要：Liblib 現金流轉正</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一家被質疑「只會抄襲+投流」的 AI 應用公司，5 月起現金流為正，付費廣告收入只佔 4%。創始人陳冕說：應用的時代還沒來，最重要的目的是活著；第一個發現 PMF 和最終贏下市場之間，差著十萬八千里。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 應用</span><span class=\"tag\">創業生存</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Earthworks spotted in the Amazon hint at huge ancient civilization LiDAR geoglyph siphuncle\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-07-29-naturepod-亚马逊地下古文明规模是预估的十倍/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9b247947db171866-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">20:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Nature Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0729</span></div>\n<h2>亞馬遜雨林下藏數萬土方，古文明人口或達三百萬</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">用 LiDAR 穿透雨林，考古學家發現亞馬遜西南部藏著數萬處土方工程，古文明面積超過 18 萬平方公里，人口峰值或達 300 萬。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">亞馬遜考古</span><span class=\"tag\">LiDAR</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Codex from 0 to 10M Users: Building ChatGPT Work — Akshay Nathan, OpenAI harness artifacts Sites Chronicle at-bats OpenClaw\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-07-28-latentspace-chatgpt-work-与-codex-是同一个-harness-差的只是-u/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ae9bcc0d8a995877-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:09:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0728</span></div>\n<h2>Codex 內部被非程序員偷用，ChatGPT Work 順勢而生</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">OpenAI 把 Codex 的 harness 原樣搬給了知識工作者，只改 UX 取捨和 sandbox 默認值；背後的判斷是職能邊界會被 AI 抹平，所以拒絕按「你是誰」劃產品線。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">agent 產品設計</span><span class=\"tag\">企業採用</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Sam Altman - How to Make an Abundant Future - [Invest Like the Best, EP.484] distillation zero-day exploit Pareto optimal frontier scaling laws\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-07-28-ilt-智能终将商品化-openai-真正的护城河是算力/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/efc93bee38b040b6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">53:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Invest Like the Best</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0728</span></div>\n<h2>智能會像 RAM 一樣商品化，OpenAI 真正的護城河是算力</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Sam Altman 復盤：智能本身會像 RAM 一樣商品化，真正持久的優勢是製造更便宜算力的能力；他還講透了 ChatGPT 意外誕生、Hugging Face 安全事件和瓶頸轉移。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力</span><span class=\"tag\">OpenAI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"148. 對遊凱超3小時訪談：開源Infra、和模型Co-design 、“如果vLLM失敗，我們會後悔一輩子” PagedAttention KV Cache Speculative Decoding MOE BYOC\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-07-28-zhangxiaojun-开源模型会赢-vllm-是-ai-推理的-linux/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b00d9a408d39cab4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">3:00:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0728</span></div>\n<h2>開源模型會贏，vLLM 是 AI 推理的 Linux</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">vLLM 已是 GitHub 最活躍的開源項目，但遊凱超真正的判斷是：模型能力無法長期隱藏，開源模型終將勝出，而推理引擎是下一個 Linux——護城河是快速迭代，不是模型本身。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">開源</span><span class=\"tag\">AI Infra</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"174: AI衝擊企業軟件巨頭？與SAP原欣聊大模型to B的顛覆與邊界 ERP FDE Human in the loop Process mining Physical AI\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-07-27-latetalk-企业软件不会死-死的是按坐席收费的模式/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fd22b63fab892cb7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"晚\"><span class=\"dur\">1:31:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">晚點聊</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0727</span></div>\n<h2>AI 打不垮 SAP，但會打碎按坐席收費的定價模式</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 不會抹平企業軟件的積累，但會打碎按坐席收費的定價模式。SAP 的防禦不是自訓基模，而是開放合作加業務理解，真正的戰場在最後一公里的流程、數據和組織慣性。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企業軟件</span><span class=\"tag\">SaaS 定價</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"國產 AI 算力能憑「超節點」彎道超車嗎? | WAIC 深度觀察 S10E23 Scale-up Scale-out UALink CloudMatrix\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-07-27-whatsnext-国产超节点总算力反超英伟达-但功耗翻五倍换不来生态/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/98eaf4baa4b6920b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"W\"><span class=\"dur\">47:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">科技早知道</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0727</span></div>\n<h2>國產超節點總算力反超英偉達，但功耗翻五倍換不來生態</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">華為 CloudMatrix 384 以約 560 千瓦功耗換來 1.7 倍於 NVL72 的總算力，但決定國產超節點命運的不是參數，而是產能和軟件生態。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力</span><span class=\"tag\">超節點</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Anthropic’s first technical PM on token maxing, the jagged edge, and living in the future | Dianne Penn token maxing jagged edge evals DRI red teaming hive mind\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-07-26-lennys-没有claude-code-opus-4-5不会有那波爆发/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2381cda2525bf028-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:33:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Lenny&#x27;s Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0726</span></div>\n<h2>沒有Claude Code，Opus 4.5不會有那波爆發</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Anthropic產品負責人復盤：模型再強也要靠Claude Code這樣的產品載體才能被用戶感知到，而PM的核心工作也從寫PRD變成了寫eval——「eval是新的PRD」。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">產品管理</span><span class=\"tag\">AI研究組織</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Iran War Oil Shock That Wasn’t...(Yet?) SPR Exchange DUCs Apparent demand Malacca Dilemma\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-07-26-chinatalk-中国用5百万桶进口消失挡掉了伊朗油价末日/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6a383006e06ec26c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:06:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0726</span></div>\n<h2>中國砍掉每日500萬桶進口，伊朗油價末日為何沒來</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">伊朗戰爭一度被預測會把油價推到200美元一桶，最終沒有出現災難，主因不是美國，而是中國默默把原油進口砍掉了每日500萬桶；這種裁量權既可以救市，也能反過來成為地緣武器。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">能源安全</span><span class=\"tag\">中美博弈</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"WarTalk: Iran War Back On, Rogue AI, Ukraine Civ-Mil IRGC Marsh Arabs Bab al-Mandeb CISA SMR\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-07-24-chinatalk-美军在伊朗没有好选项-ai-杀开关也拦不住模型/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0a994bc6ac4ef9d9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:03:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0724</span></div>\n<h2>美軍在伊朗沒有好選項，AI 殺開關也攔不住模型</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">伊朗地形讓任何地面戰都無從下手，而霍爾木茲的消耗戰正在燒掉美軍的全球部署餘量；AI 監管的真正難題不是給 DHS 一個殺開關，而是沒人願意控制算力這個原材料。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中東</span><span class=\"tag\">美軍後勤</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The Doors of Death: The Herald of Free Enterprise roll-on/roll-off ferry (RoRo) Swiss cheese model corporate manslaughter controlling mind pacing problem\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-07-24-cautionary-没人确认舱门已关-制度性漫不经心才是元凶/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b996da73a08744ac-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">37:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Cautionary Tales</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0724</span></div>\n<h2>沒人確認艙門已關：制度性漫不經心才是元兇</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1987年，滾裝渡輪 Herald of Free Enterprise 因艙門未關而側翻，193人遇難。真正的元兇不是睡著的船員，而是讓每個人都覺得「這不歸我管」的制度。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">海難</span><span class=\"tag\">組織失誤</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"E245｜藏在大模型背後的新聞人：GPT們的回覆是這樣寫出來的 Content Engineer System Prompt Few-shot Example Voice Agent Parasocial Relationship\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-07-24-sv101-ai的懂你-是内容工程师一句句调教出来的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cfe8fa9f8e3fa476-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"硅\"><span class=\"dur\">46:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">硅谷101</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0724</span></div>\n<h2>AI的懂你，是內容工程師一句句調教出來的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">曾經寫新聞的人轉身成為AI的內容工程師，把提問、共情和分寸感拆成訓練規則——AI的「懂你」由此而來，但基於共識的訓練也讓他們承認：偉大的藝術不會從這裡長出來。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">內容工程師</span><span class=\"tag\">後訓練</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Inside the Model Factory — Eiso Kant, Poolside AI RSI MCP FP8/NVFP4 DGX Spark prefill/decode disaggregation\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-07-23-latentspace-poolside-小模型的持久性-比参数量更重要/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b0ae86616b939d17-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:54:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0723</span></div>\n<h2>小模型死磕8周，能打破基礎模型寡頭壟斷嗎</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Poolside用總參1180億、激活80億的小模型證明，持久性和驗證行為比單純堆參數量更能提升編程能力，這讓他們相信開源小模型能打破巨頭壟斷的未來。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">開源模型</span><span class=\"tag\">模型訓練</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Kimi K3, Xi&#x27;s Speech, and China&#x27;s Mythos Moment mythos Glass Wing Let It Rip Black Box harness\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-07-22-chinatalk-中国开源模型逼近前沿-美国该慌还是该算账/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/84d4e71ceec6631a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">59:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0722</span></div>\n<h2>中國開源模型逼近前沿，美國該慌還是該算賬</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Kimi K3 打碎了「美國模型遙遙領先」的幻覺，但真正的分水嶺不是誰先到 mythos，而是開源這一層賺不到錢、下游卻照樣能長出東西。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中國AI</span><span class=\"tag\">開源模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Open models recap: more on Kimi K3, Qwen 3.8, Xi&#x27;s WAIC speech, distillation, the open-closed gap, and what&#x27;s next distillation rollout grading model / judge mid-training shadow ban fine-tunability\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-07-22-interconnects-开源追上前沿不是靠蒸馏-因为没人知道蒸馏怎么才管用/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b69e8536b2b28144-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">49:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Interconnects</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0722</span></div>\n<h2>開源追平閉源不是靠蒸餾：沒人知道怎麼蒸餾才有用</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Nathan Lambert 逐條拆掉「中國開源模型只是蒸餾出來的」這個敘事：RL 階段用 Fable/GPT 5.6 當裁判在成本上根本跑不通，而即便白送最強模型的 reasoning traces，學界至今不知道怎麼把它變成能力提升。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">開源模型</span><span class=\"tag\">蒸餾</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"28納米反超1000倍?不需要EUV的芯片黑魔法：對話知存科技王紹迪 Von Neumann architecture NOR Flash NAND Flash EDA INT4 Universal Memory\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-07-22-laoshi-模型越大-28纳米存算芯片反而越强/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/83e6fe7e812c63f5-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"老\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">老石談芯</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0722</span></div>\n<h2>28納米芯片反超1000倍：不用EUV的存算一體黑魔法</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">知存科技把28納米Flash做成存算一體芯片，靠陣列越大能效越高的物理特性，讓效率隨模型變大反而提升，Transformer對它是純粹利好。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">存算一體</span><span class=\"tag\">AI芯片</span>\n</div></div></a>"]